    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "#4816\n\"I don't know how much this motorcycle is\" should be \"I don't know how much this motorcycle would cost.\"",
      "html": "#4816<br/>\"I don't know how much this motorcycle is\" should be \"I don't know how much this motorcycle would cost.\"",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "be75cb9493e046999e2c1bd3865a76a027e183d2fb4568a4a3089cc5fdfcdef6",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "fixed, but not sure if the english was wrong to start with really...",
      "html": "fixed, but not sure if the english was wrong to start with really...",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "fc393fc885f21f1748f673e84986a2f334f2118aa45fceb9468f3cd0fd88512a",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Just a note to say that いくらか is a completely diferent word meaning \"a relatively small amount.\" \n\nいくらか得したの = Did you make some gain?\nいくら得したの = HOw much gain did you make?",
      "html": "Just a note to say that いくらか is a completely diferent word meaning \"a relatively small amount.\" <br/><br/>いくらか得したの = Did you make some gain?<br/>いくら得したの = HOw much gain did you make?",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "0a127826015496723ed77323caac18881b7ff1685175ad2bdf3e68a20c68c574",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I'm not sure it's wrong per se, but it is bad English because it's unclear when stated alone. In a known context it would be fine, but alone it could mean anything like, \"I don't know how much this motorcycle is loved.\"",
      "html": "I'm not sure it's wrong per se, but it is bad English because it's unclear when stated alone. In a known context it would be fine, but alone it could mean anything like, \"I don't know how much this motorcycle is loved.\"",
      "credits_raw": "feralkat",
      "content_sha256": "524deff8c681ae42fd5477c5e271ec52b6a87dbfdad188ad27f84ef7a494118d",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "...and I concur with bamboo4 that いくらか means \"some,\" and could be confusing Japanese to a non-native speaker, but in this case and in this context it clearly means \"how much?\"",
      "html": "...and I concur with bamboo4 that いくらか means \"some,\" and could be confusing Japanese to a non-native speaker, but in this case and in this context it clearly means \"how much?\"",
